    nif:isString "CRICKET - ENGLAND 326 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN IN THIRD TEST .  LONDON 1996-08-23  England were all out for 326 in their first innings on the second day of the third and final test against Pakistan at The Oval on Friday .  Score : England 326 ( J. Crawley 106 , G. Thorpe 54 .  Waqar Younis 4-95 ) " .

