    nif:isString "PRESS DIGEST - FRANCE - LE MONDE AUG 26 .  PARIS 1996-08-26  These are leading stories in Monday 's afternoon daily Le Monde , dated Aug 27 .  FRONT PAGE  -- Ipsos poll reports majority of French public opinion sympathises with plight of Africans seeking to renew or obtain work and residence permits , calling government \" stubborn , \" \" confused \" and \" cold-hearted . \"  BUSINESS PAGES  -- SNCF railway trade unions want renegotiation of government bailout package , as European Union prepares more proposals to increase competition .  -- World steel market shows signs of upturn .  -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81 " .

