    nif:isString "Port conditions update - Syria - Lloyds Shipping .  Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --  LATTAKIA , Aug 10 - waiting time at Lattakia and Tartous presently 24 hours . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/04419493cb5541888e29807faf31eca0b8438d25add3704b7c4c86dc9bafd7cf> a nif:Context,
