    nif:isString "TENNIS - GRAND SLAM CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS .  MUNICH , Germany 1996-12-06  Quarter-final results at the $ 6 million Grand Slam Cup tennis tournament on Friday : Goran Ivanisevic ( Croatia ) beat Mark Woodforde ( Australia ) 6-4 6-4  Yevgeny Kafelnikov ( Russia ) beat Jim Courier ( U.S. ) 2-6 6-4 8-6 " .

