    nif:isString "Ten missing in north China ship collision .  BEIJING 1996-08-27  Ten people were missing after a fishing boat collided with a passenger liner and sank off China 's northeastern province of Liaoning , state radio said on Tuesday .  The fishing boat sank and its entire crew was missing after a collision with the \" Tiantan \" liner off the port of Dalian early on Monday , the report said .  It said the liner was heading to Dalian from the northern port of Tianjin , it said .  Dalian port officials , contacted by telephone , confirmed the collision but gave no further details . " .

