    nif:isString "RUGBY UNION - SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ALL BLACKS 32-22 .  JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-31  South Africa beat New Zealand 32-22 ( haltime 16-8 ) in the final test match of their three-test series at Ellis Park on Saturday .  Scorers :  South Africa - Tries : Joost van der Westhuizen ( 2 ) , Andre Joubert .  Conversion : Henry Honiball .  Penalties : Honiball ( 2 ) , Joubert ( 3 ) .  New Zealand - Tries : Sean Fitzpatrick , Walter Little , Justin Marshall .  Conversions : Andrew Mehrtens ( 2 ) .  Penalties : Mehrtens .  New Zealand win test series 2-1 . " .

