    nif:isString "SOCCER - WALES BEAT SAN MARINO 4-0 IN UNDER-21 MATCH .  BARRY , Wales 1996-08-30  Wales beat San Marino 4-0 ( halftime 2-0 ) in a European under-21 soccer match on Friday .  Scorers :  Wales - John Hartson ( 12th , 56th and 83rd minutes ) , Scott Young ( 24th )  Attendance : 1,800 " .

