    nif:isString "Telkom at $ 35 in London .  LONDON 1996-12-07  PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia ( Telkom ) closed at $ 35 in London on Friday .  It recorded the day 's low of $ 34.475 and the day 's high of $ 35.375 .  Its previous close on Thursday as $ 35.63 .  One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 . " .

