    nif:isString "ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN 'S WORLD CUP SUPER G RESULTS .  VAIL , Colorado 1996-12-07  Provisional results from  Saturday 's women 's World Cup super G race :  1. Svetlana Gladishiva ( Russia ) one minute 17.76 seconds  2. Pernila Wiberg ( Sweden ) 1:17.97  3. Carole Montillet ( France ) 1:18.11  4. Hilde Gerg ( Germany ) 1:18.15  5. Isolde Kostner ( Italy ) 1:18.19  6. Warwara Zelenskaja ( Russia ) 1:18.21  7. Madlen Brigger-Summermatter ( Switzerland ) 1:18.23  8. Florence Masnada ( France ) 1:18.31  9. Katja Seizinger ( Germany ) 1:18.32  10= Martina Ertl ( Germany ) 1:18.48  10= Stefanie Schuster ( Austria ) 1:18.48  12. Bibiana Perez ( Italy ) 1:18.52  13. Barbara Merlin ( Italy ) 1:18.67  14. Sybille Brauner ( Germany ) 1:18.81  15. Katharina Gutensohn ( Germany ) 1:18.92  16. Leatitia Dalloz ( France ) 1:18.96  17. Renate Goetschl ( Austria ) 1:18.98  18. Marianne Brechu ( France ) 1:19.02  19. Heidi Zurbriggen ( Switzerland ) 1:19.03  20. Spela Bracun ( Slovenia ) 1:19.07  21. Shannon Nobis ( U.S. ) 1:19.08  22= Regine Cavagnoud ( France ) 1:19.21  22= Anita Wachter ( Austria ) 1:19.21  24. Megan Gerety ( U.S. ) 1:19.39  25. Hilary Lindh ( U.S. ) 1:19.41  26= Catherine Borghi ( Switzerland ) 1:19.44  26= Michaela Dorfmeister ( Austria ) 1:19.44  28. Alexandra Meissnitzer ( Austria ) 1:19.53  29. Ingeborg Helen Marken ( Norway ) 1:19.54  30. Monika Tschirky ( Switzerland ) 1:19.60  The results were declared official . " .

