    nif:endIndex "395"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "Key Clinton aide resigns , NBC says .  CHICAGO 1996-08-29  Dick Morris , the Republican political consultant who reshaped U.S. President Bill Clinton 's reelection campaign , has resigned , MS-NBC News reported Thursday .  Morris drew the ire of liberal Clinton aides for repositioning the president in the political centre .  There was no immediate comment on the report from the White House . " .

