    nif:isString "SOCCER - AZERBAIJAN BEAT SWITZERLAND IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER .  BAKU 1996-08-31  Azerbaijan beat Switzerland 1-0 ( halftime 1-0 ) in their World Cup soccer European group three qualifying match on Saturday .  Scorer :  Vidadi Rzayev ( 28th )  Attendance : 20,000 " .

