    nif:isString "Banco de Mexico to inject 3.412 bln pesos .  MEXICO CITY 1996-08-26  Banco de Mexico sought to inject 3.412 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday through three credit auctions , dealers said .  The auctions were offered as follows :  AMOUNT TERM  1.206 bln 9 days  1.206 bln 3 days  1.000 bln 1 day  - Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559 " .

