    nif:isString "Colombia police find marijuana on ship .  BOGOTA , Colombia 1996-08-29  Police said they found 35 metric tons of marijuana on Thursday on a ship preparing to set sail for the Netherlands from Colombia 's Caribbean port of Cartagena .  They said the drug had been packed into a shipping container and was surrounded by ground coffee .  No arrests had been made , a police spokesman said . " .

