    nif:isString "SOCCER - WALES BEAT SAN MARINO IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER .  CARDIFF 1996-08-31  Wales beat San Marino 6-0 ( halftime 4-0 ) in a World Cup soccer European group 7 qualifier on Saturday .  Scorers : Dean Saunders ( 2nd minute , 75th ) , Mark Hughes ( 25th , 54th ) , Andy Melville ( 33rd ) , John Robinson ( 45th ) .  Attendance : 15,150 " .

