    nif:isString "ATHLETICS - CHRISTIE TO RUN IN BERLIN .  LONDON 1996-08-29  Linford Christie has confirmed he will run in a \" Dream Team \" sprint relay at the Berlin grand prix athletics meeting on Friday .  A spokeswoman for Christie said the former Olympic 100 metres champion had agreed to captain a quality quartet which also includes Canada 's Donovan Bailey , the current Olympic champion and world record holder , and Namibian Frankie Fredericks .  Christie is retiring from international competition at the end of the season , but Berlin promoter Rudi Thiel has persuaded him to join what is intended to be a special tribute to Jesse Owens , who won four gold medals 60 years ago at the Berlin Olympics . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/206c617c2fbc7fd7eb7a9fad0a2d9ab765c55e46cc7613f0278d6375d43722fe> a nif:Context,
