    nif:isString "PRESS DIGEST - Washington Post business - Aug 26 .  WASHINGTON 1996-08-26  The Washington Post carried only local business stories on August 26 , 1996 . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/21575f188f176d76351a0787e8e245fbb5164c76ff642a205f0f197eb4719a9b> a nif:Context,
