    nif:isString "WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Dec 6 .  MOSCOW 1996-12-06  No weather-related closures of CIS airports are expected on December 7 and 8 , the Russian Weather Service said on Friday .  -- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520 " .

