    nif:isString "SOCCER - BELARUS BEAT ESTONIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER .  MINSK 1996-08-31  Belarus beat Estonia 1-0 ( halftime 1-0 ) in a World Cup soccer European group 4 qualifier on Saturday .  Scorer : Vladimir Makovsky ( 35th )  Attendance : 6,000 " .

