    nif:isString "CRICKET - RAIN BRINGS PREMATURE END TO SRI LANKA MATCH .  COLOMBO 1996-08-24  The one-day match between Sri Lanka and a World XI was abandoned on Saturday because of rain .  Scores : World XI 102-0 ( M. Waugh 39 not out , S. Tendulkar 56 not out ) off 21.4 overs v Sri Lanka . " .

