    nif:isString "CRICKET - SRI LANKA BEAT INDIA BY 9 WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH .  COLOMBO 1996-08-28  Sri Lanka beat India by nine wickets in the second match of the Singer World Series one-day ( 50 overs ) cricket tournament on Monday .  Scores : India 226-5 in 50 overs , Sri Lanka 230-1 in 44.2 overs . " .

