    nif:beginIndex "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:endIndex "530"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "ITALIAN CABINET APPROVES TELEVISION DECREE .  ROME 1996-08-28  The Italian cabinet on Wednesday granted a reprieve for media mogul Silvio Berlusconi 's Mediaset television empire with a decree extending the current legal framework for television stations until January 31 , 1997 .  The decree plugs a legal void in which magistrates could have forced the former prime minister to take one of the three stations he controls off the air because of a court ruling that no single proprietor should be allowed to keep three channels . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/258c9f27c428fedb0c1345db812d0adbd3e2f230fef8c26528abcc376b02fd8b> a nif:Context,
        nif:OffsetBasedString ;
