    nif:isString "SOCCER - ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS .  BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-26  Results of matches on the  opening weekend of the Argentine Apertura championship :  Estudiantes 2 Boca Juniors 3  Ferro Carril Oeste 0 Independiente 3  Gimnasia-Jujuy 1 Platense 0  Huracan 0 Lanus 0  Huracan-Corrientes 3 Union 6  Newell 's Old Boys 0 Velez Sarsfield 2  Racing Club 0 Rosario Central 2  River Plate 0 Gimnasia-La Plata 0  San Lorenzo 0 Banfield 1  Playing Monday : Deportivo Espanol v Colon  Note : the Apertura is the first of two championships played  in the Argentine season .  The teams meet each other once in each  tournament .  There is no overall champion . " .

