    nif:isString "SOCCER - ARAB CONTRACTORS WIN AFRICAN CUP WINNERS ' CUP .  CAIRO 1996-12-06  Result of the second leg of the African Cup Winners ' Cup final at the National stadium on Friday : Arab Contractors ( Egypt ) 4 Sodigraf ( Zaire ) 0 ( halftime 2-0 )  Scorers :  Aly Ashour 7 , 56 penalty , Mohamed Ouda 24 , 73  Contractors won 4-0 on aggregate . " .

