    nif:isString "BASKETBALL - OLYMPIAKOS BEAT RED STAR 71-57 .  BELGRADE 1996-08-28  Olympiakos of Greece beat Yugoslavia 's Red Star 71-57 ( halftime 40-34 ) in the first match of an international club basketball tournament on Wednesday .  Partizan ( Yugoslavia ) , Alba ( Germany ) , Dinamo ( Russia ) and Benetton ( Italy ) are also taking part in the event which continues until Saturday . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/302fcf8cc70981349c446e71be6e91fb6cf1e50af6691aaed32c4161408e64cb> a nif:Context,
