    nif:isString "Frankfurt dollar fix 1.5338 marks .  FRANKFURT 1996-12-06  The dollar was fixed at 1.5338 marks in Frankfurt on Friday , after 1.5607 marks on Thursday .  There was no Bundesbank intervention . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/308bd57699d0ad1b660bfe36f80c9012950afedc91ebf9f6f4ce6ef81b325736> a nif:Context,
