    nif:isString "Manitoba Pork forward contract PM prices - Dec 6 .  WINNIPEG 1996-12-06  Manitoba Pork closing forward contract prices in Canadian dollars per hundred lbs ( Cwt ) for Dec 6 including minimum guaranteed price --  CONTRACT PREVIOUS CLOSE PM CLOSE PM CLOSING RANGE  DATE PM CLOSE FIXED MINIMUM AT 1230 CST  Feb 97 79.94 79.67 75.55 77.01-81.80  Mar 97 76.37 76.12 72.02 73.47-78.24  Apr 97 74.13 74.69 70.59 72.04-76.81  May 97 76.51 77.07 72.97 74.42-79.19  Jun 97 77.53 77.24 73.17 74.62-79.35  Jul 97 74.45 74.01 69.95 71.39-76.12  Aug 97 72.41 72.07 68.01 69.45-74.18  Sep 97 69.18 69.24 65.17 66.61-71.34  Oct 97 68.00 68.05 63.98 65.43-70.16  Nov 97 68.00 68.05 63.98 65.43-70.16  Note : Manitoba Government Price Index ( C$ per cwt ) -  Dec 4 87.16  Manitoba 's Hog Price Range : 84.00-86.00 per cwt  CAN / U.S. DOLLAR EXCHANGE RATE : 1.3570  Source : Manitoba Pork .  ( ( Winnipeg bureau 204-947-3548 ) ) " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/329e5d49d2bf55c647425606fefb279a4669cc1eba4ebdf2dbdf815d81969d81> a nif:Context,
