    nif:isString "RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts SNET .  -- Lehman analyst Blake Bath started Southern New England Telecommunciations Corp with an outperform rating , his office said .  -- The analyst set a 12-month price target of $ 45 and a fiscal 1996 year earnings estimate of $ 3.09 per share , his office said .  -- The analyst also set an earnings estimate for the 1997 year , but the figure was not immediately available .  -- Southern New England closed at 38-1/2 Wednesday .  -- E. Auchard , Wall Street bureau , 212-859-1736 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/355a4f3ab020eea0e0e9160d8a116f375a06df2533e359886e7a8a4ae0000972> a nif:Context,
