    nif:isString "Timah at 15.625 in London at 0931 GMT .  LONDON 1996-12-06  PT Tambang Timah was traded at $ 15.625 per GDR in London on Friday at around 0931 GMT .  It recorded a low of $ 15.625 and a high of $ 15.725 .  Its previous close on Thursday was $ 15.80 .  One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares .  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 " .

