    nif:isString "BASKETBALL - INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT RESULT .  BELGRADE 1996-08-30  Result in an international  basketball tournament on Friday :  Red Star ( Yugoslavia ) beat Dinamo ( Russia ) 92-90 ( halftime  47-47 ) " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/37555b590f33c24031fd74d2a9e78fb57171b547b1ef831f6ce7b7835ea21912> a nif:Context,
