    nif:isString "SOCCER - ROMANIA BEAT LITHUANIA IN U-21 QUALIFIER .  BUCHAREST 1996-08-30  Romania beat 2-1 ( halftime 1-1 ) Lithuania in their European Under-21 soccer match on Friday .  Scorers :  Romania - Cosmin Contra ( 31st ) , Mihai Tararache ( 75th )  Lithuania - Danius Gleveckas ( 13rd )  Attendence : 200 " .

