    nif:isString "Thai rice vessels loading and movements at Dec 06 .  BANGKOK 1996-11-29  The Thai Commerce Ministry detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows ( in tonnes ) :  Vessel Date of Arrival Quantity Destination  Iran Sabr 19/11/96 9,000 Iran  Princess of Loine 19/11/96 10,000 Philippines  Deligst 20/11/96 5,500 Indonesia  Seagramd ace 20/11/96 5,000 Japan  Lucky Emdldm 20/11/96 5,000 Japan  Algoa Day 21/11/96 6,000 Africa  Sangthai Glory 22/11/96 3,000 Singapore  Myos Yang 5 22/11/96 4,000 Indonesia  Budisuryana 22/11/96 3,800 Malaysia  King Ace 22/11/96 5,000 Japan  Tong Shun 25/11/96 3,000 Vietnam  But 2 27/11/96 5,000 Burma  -- Bangkok newsroom ( 662 ) 652-0642 " .

