    nif:isString "SOCCER - FRENCH FIRST DIVISION RESULT .  PARIS 1996-08-27  Result of a French first division  soccer match played on Tuesday :  Auxerre 0 Marseille 0 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/46eb63225db664cc7eb435106fb07be4baecd1a18b84ef49f601afb845f89fd3> a nif:Context,
