    nif:isString "SOCCER - MAURITANIA DRAW WITH BENIN IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP .  NOUAKCHOTT 1996-08-31  Mauritania drew 0-0 with Benin in their African Nations Cup preliminary round , second leg soccer match on Friday .  Benin won 4-1 on aggregate . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/472ad68e462ba2e9b3a6db4408aa2e61ae52f5b4c68cfca14e4cae1933026430> a nif:Context,
