    nif:isString "Indian Sept crude oil output falls to 2.6 mln T .  NEW DELHI 1996-12-06  India 's crude petroleum output fell to 2.56 million tonnes in September from 2.83 million in the same month in 1995 , the government said on Friday .  STEEL OUTPUT Sept Sept Apr-Sept Apr-Sept  1996 1995 1996 1995  Crude petroleum 2,557 2,832 15,838 17,648  Petroleum products 4,605 5,110 30,589 29,328  Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary . " .

