    nif:isString "Alpha Techs closes Lockhart purchase .  NEW YORK 1996-08-23  Alpha Technologies Group Inc said it had closed on its agreement to acquire Lockhart Industries Inc .  The company said in a statement late on Thursday that it issued 280,556 shares of common stock for the stock of Lockhart .  These shares are subject to post-closing adjustments .  Lockhart , based in Paramount , Calif. , is a designer and manufacturer of sophisticated thermal management products .  -- New York newsroom , ( 212 ) 859-1610 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/47f1fdc0cd72a92921f205992851c038d476485e4b103427e67355bc34c12440> a nif:Context,
