    nif:isString "CRICKET - PAKISTAN 473-6 AT TEA ON FOURTH DAY THIRD TEST .  LONDON 1996-08-25  Pakistan were 473-6 at tea on the fourth day of the third and final test at The Oval on Sunday in reply to England 's 326 .  Scores : England 326 ; Pakistan 473-6 . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/48e5aaef4133b7fff99575b6aa3900f0fc2f94c5650ba1801b6de822c11c68c3> a nif:Context,
