    nif:isString "Tambang Timah at $ 15.575 in London .  LONDON 1996-12-07  PT Tambang Timah closed at $ 15.575 per GDR in London on Friday .  It recorded the day 's low of $ 15.475 and the day 's high of $ 15.725 .  It closed at $ 15.80 on Thursday .  One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares .  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 " .

