    nif:isString "SOCCER - ETHIOPIA BEAT UGANDA ON PENALTIES IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP .  ADDIS ABABA 1996-08-25  Ethiopia and Uganda drew 1-1  ( halftime 1-0 ) in their African Nations Cup preliminary round ,  second leg match on Sunday .  Attendance : 25,000  Aggregate 2-2 .  Ethiopia won 4-2 penalties . " .

