    nif:isString "Oldest Albania book disappears from Vatican - paper .  TIRANA 1996-08-23  A 16th-century document , the earliest complete example of written Albanian , has disappeared from the Vatican archives , an Albanian newspaper said on Friday .  Gazeta Shqiptare said the \" Book of Mass ' , by Gjon Buzuku , dating from 1555 and discovered in 1740 in a religious seminary in Rome , was the first major document published in the Albanian language .  \" We Albanians , sons of Buzuku , believed our language had a written document but now we do not have it any more , \" lamented scholar Musa Hamiti , told of the loss by the Vatican library .  Tirana 's national library has three copies of the \" Book of Mass ' . \"  There is nothing left for us but to be grateful to civilisation for inventing photocopies , \" Gazeta Shqiptare said . " .

