    nif:isString "SOCCER - DUTCH DRAW 2-2 WITH BRAZIL IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL .  AMSTERDAM 1996-08-31  The Netherlands drew 2-2 with  Brazil ( half-time 0-1 ) in a soccer friendly on Saturday .  Scorers :  Netherlands - Ronald de Boer ( 52nd minute ) , Van Gastel  ( 90th , pen )  Brazil - Giovanni ( 14th ) , Marcello Goncalves ( 55th ) " .

