    nif:isString "SOCCER - SPAIN PICK UNCAPPED ARMANDO FOR WORLD CUP CLASH .  MADRID 1996-12-06  Spain coach Javier Clemente has added uncapped Deportivo Coruna midfielder Armando Alvarez to his squad for the World Cup qualifier against Yugoslavia on December 14 .  \" I do n't believe it ...  I thought it was a joke , \" said Armando who replaces injured Atletico Madrid playmaker Jose Luis Caminero . " .

