    nif:isString "Texas / w Okla fed cattle roundup - USDA .  AMARILLO 1996-12-06  Trade very slow in the Panhandle area Thursday .  Slaughter steers and heifers not well tested .  Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers .  - USDA  Thursday 200 Week Ago Holiday Year Ago 10,900  Wk to Date 69,100 Week Ago 58,100 Year Ago 30,800  Sales reported on 200 head steers ; 69,100 head confirmed for week to date which includes 14,000 formulated and 3,400 contracted cattle to be shipped this week .  Slaughter Steers : Pen Select and Choice 2-3 , 1150 lbs 67.00 .  Pen Select , few choice 2-3 1150 lbs 66.00 . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/52d8fbc2ec7a642450050550d936613cd6a36a7dd0ae363b69a1cdd3dcb39872> a nif:Context,
