    nif:endIndex "457"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "Fire destroys restaurant in Bahraini village .  MANAMA 1996-08-31  A fire has completely gutted a Turkish-operated restaurant in a Bahraini village , residents said .  They said a fire broke out at Shul'ala restaurant in the early hours on Saturday in al-Daih village , five km ( three miles ) west of the capital Manama .  It was not immediately clear what caused the fire or if there were any casualties .  Government officials had no immediate comment . " .

