    nif:isString "SQUASH - MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL SEMIFINAL RESULTS .  BOMBAY , India 1996-12-06  Results of semifinals in the Mahindra International squash tournament on Friday :  Peter Nicol ( Scotland ) beat Simon Parke ( England ) 15-7 15-12 15-12 Rodney Eyles ( Australia ) beat Mark Cairns ( England ) 15-7 15-6 15-8 .  Final : Nicol v Eyles , on Saturday . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/554fa20ecf2fa5c6877d2f602b9a81ec3ece34b597ec1da5f85e2cbc012062b6> a nif:Context,
