    nif:isString "Bangladesh June M2 up 3.8 pct m / m , up 8.2 pct y / y .  DHAKA 1996-08-27  Bangladesh 's M2 money supply rose 3.8 percent in June to 456.8 billion taka after a 0.27 percent rise to 439.9 billion in May , central bank officials said .  The year-on-year rise was 8.2 percent to June , 1996 .  BANGLADESH 'S MONEY SUPPLY  JUNE MAY JUNE 1995  M2 money supply ( bln taka ) 456.8 439.9 422.1  M1 money supply ( bln taka ) 144.5 139.3 131.7 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/558038beead522a528418d9fe19bc605295d2238e25d52f59e9a1e7ad1d3e930> a nif:Context,
        nif:OffsetBasedString ;
