    nif:isString "Moslem fundamentalists kill 19 Algerians - agency .  PARIS 1996-12-06  Moslem fundamentalists killed 19 civilians overnight in Blida province south of Algiers , Algerian security forces said on Friday .  In a statement carried on the official Algerian news agency APS , the security forces said the 19 had been killed by \" a group of terrorists \" . " .

