    nif:isString "East Dries miners fail to report for work .  JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30  Workers at Driefontein Consolidated Ltd 's east gold mine have failed to report for work since Wednesday night , mine managers Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd said on Friday .  \" Discussions with employee and union representatives are continuing , \" the company said in a statement .  It gave no further details .  At least 17 miners have been killed in labour unrest -- sparked by ethnic differences -- at Driefontein Consolidated and Gold Fields ' Kloof Gold Mining Co this month .  -- Johannesburg newsroom , +27-11 482 1003 " .

