    nif:endIndex "353"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "SOCCER - KEANE SIGNS FOUR-YEAR CONTRACT WITH MANCHESTER UNITED .  LONDON 1996-08-22  Ireland midfielder Roy Keane has signed a new four-year contract with English league and F.A. Cup champions Manchester United .  \" Roy agreed a new deal before last night 's game against Everton and we are delighted , \" said United manager Alex Ferguson on Thursday . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/5e26f26cd1ccc036e6b9e6560e4346b4193586613d8f0d629c5941aa7ca83b6c> a nif:Context,
