    nif:isString "UK-US open skies talks end , no date to restart .  LONDON 1996-12-06  The UK Department of Transport on Friday said that the latest round of \" open skies \" talks with the U.S. had ended with no deal on liberalising the transatlantic flight market and no date set for when talks would restart .  A spokesman for the DOT told Reuters \" We have had talks towards concluding a new air service agreement which would produce liberalisation ...  useful progress was made on a number of issues , but not all .  No date has been set for further talks . \" " .

