    nif:isString "TENNIS - RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC .  CARLSBAD , Calif. 1996-08-24  Results from the $ 450,000 Toshiba Classic tennis tournament on Saturday ( prefix number denotes seeding ) :  Semifinals :  1 - Arantxa Sanchez Vicario ( Spain ) beat 3 - Jana Novotna ( Czech Republic ) 1-6 , 6-2 6-3  4 - Kimiko Date ( Japan ) beat 2 - Conchita Martinez ( Spain ) 6-2 7-5 . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/6c8240ba34965e8764d961328caea7b0b1b2086cc5b84d39193d3cb9ee193c1e> a nif:Context,
