    nif:isString "SOCCER - FIORENTINA BEAT MILAN IN ITALIAN SUPERCUP .  MILAN 1996-08-25  Italian Cup winners Fiorentina beat  league champions Milan 2-1 ( halftime 1-1 ) in the pre-season  Supercoppa ( SuperCup ) in Milan on Sunday :  Scorers :  Fiorentina - Gabriel Batistuta ( 11th , 83rd )  Milan - Dejan Savicevic ( 21st )  Attendance : 29,582 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/733304bf83262f72c0d1a05ddbf81cbed73877833cadec8ca49e34b3e9ba20a5> a nif:Context,
