    nif:endIndex "456"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "AMTRAK train hits truck , derails in Vermont .  MONTPELIER , Vt .  1996-08-27  An Amtrak train struck a logging truck early on Tuesday and derailed , Vermont state police said .  A state police spokeswoman said there were reports of minor injuries as a result of the derailment near Roxbury , a small town on the edge of the Northfield Mountains some 15 miles southwest of Montpelier , the state capital .  Further details were not immediately available . " .

