    nif:isString "USDA gross cutout hide and offal value .  DES MOINES 1996-08-29  The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for Thursday was estimated at $ 9.76 per cwt live , up $ 0.03 when compared with Wednesday 's value .  - USDA " .

