    nif:isString "CYCLING - KELLY WINS WORLD TIME TRIAL TITLE .  MANCHESTER , England 1996-08-28  Shane Kelly of Australia retained the world one-kilometre time trial title at the world track championships on Wednesday , with a track record time of one minute 2.777 seconds .  Kelly averaged 57.345 kph to beat Soren Lausgberg of Germany by eighteen hundredths of a second .  The bronze medal went to another German , Jan Van Eijden , in 1:04.541 . " .

