    nif:isString "RUGBY LEAGUE - EUROPEAN SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS / STANDINGS .  LONDON 1996-08-24  Results of European Super League  rugby league matches on Saturday :  Paris 14 Bradford 27  Wigan 78 Workington 4  Standings ( tabulated under played , won , drawn , lost , points  for , against , total points ) :  Wigan 22 19 1 2 902 326 39  St Helens 21 19 0 2 884 441 38  Bradford 22 17 0 5 767 409 34  Warrington 21 12 0 9 555 499 24  London 21 11 1 9 555 462 23  Sheffield 21 10 0 11 574 696 20  Halifax 21 9 1 11 603 552 19  Castleford 21 9 0 12 548 543 18  Oldham 21 8 1 12 439 656 17  Leeds 21 6 0 15 531 681 12  Paris 22 3 1 18 398 795 7  Workington 22 2 1 19 325 1021 5 " .

