    nif:isString "CRICKET - PAKISTAN 339-4 V ENGLAND - close .  Saeed Anwar c Croft b Cork 176  Aamir Sohail c Cork b Croft 46  Ijaz Ahmed c Stewart b Mullally 61  Inzamam-ul-Haq c Hussain b Mullally 35  Salim Malik not out 2  Asif Mujtaba not out 1  Extras 18  Fall of wicket - 1-106 2-239 3-334 4-334  To bat - Wasim Akram , Moin Khan , Mushtaq Ahmed , Waqar Younis , Mohammad Akam  England 326 all out " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/859d7084385d7a1c0def6faae74030c6edcef08f649ab16f1c166c0e35cf08f7> a nif:Context,
