    nif:isString "WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - August 27 .  MOSCOW 1996-08-27  No closures of airports due to bad weather are expected in the Commonwealth of Independent States on August 28 and August 29 , the Russian Weather Service said on Tuesday .  -- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520 " .

