    nif:isString "RALLYING - LEADING POSITIONS IN 1,000 LAKES RALLY .  JYVASKYLA , Finland 1996-08-25  Leading positions  after six of Sunday 's 12 special stages in the 1,000 Lakes Rally , sixth round of the world championship :  1. Juha Kankkunen ( Finland ) Toyota Celica 2 hours 30 minutes  52 seconds  3. Tommi Makinen ( Finland ) Mitsubishi Lancer 8 seconds  behind  2. Marcus Gronholm ( Finland ) Toyota Celica 1:46  4. Jarmo Kytolehto ( Finland ) Ford Escort 1:56  5. Kenneth Eriksson ( Sweden ) Subaru Impreza 2:05  6. Thomas Radstrom ( Sweden ) Toyota Celica 2:23 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/86c3420afb94b28106d6febc6d72d709b2fa3c86624b012899988c88b24e4c85> a nif:Context,
