    nif:isString "HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LARGELY UNCHANGED .  HELSINKI 1996-08-27  Helibor market interest rates  were largely unchanged at the Bank of Finland 's daily fixing on  Tuesday .  The key three-month rate was steady at 3.40 percent .  August 27 fix August 26 fix  1-mth Helibor 3.27 pct 3.29 pct  2-mth Helibor 3.34 pct 3.34 pct  3-mth Helibor 3.40 pct 3.40 pct  6-mth Helibor 3.56 pct 3.55 pct  9-mth Helibor 3.73 pct 3.70 pct  12-mth Helibor 3.89 pct 3.87 pct  -- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 248 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/86e8459e471c29785235f23d260343f45ad29f7ba5eea37ac9d969819cbdfcbd> a nif:Context,
