    nif:isString "SOCCER - HONDURAS BEAT CUBA 4-0 IN FRIENDLY .  TEGUCIGALPA 1996-08-26  Honduras beat Cuba 4-0  ( halftime 3-0 ) in a friendly soccer international on Sunday .  Scorers : Juan Castro ( 3rd minute ) , Enrique Centeno ( 33rd and  84th ) , Carlos Pavon ( 37th ) " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/87c79d3beca5c5a5c680f6b31623b456924d851e01e7bffe938c9a091756f36b> a nif:Context,
