    nif:isString "SOCCER - BELGIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS .  BRUSSELS 1996-08-24  Results of Belgian first  division matches on Saturday :  Standard Liege 3 Molenbeek 0  Anderlecht 2 Lokeren 2  Cercle Brugge 2 Mouscron 2  Antwerp 1 Lommel 4  Ghent 3 Aalst 2  Lierse 4 Charleroi 0  Sint Truiden 3 Ekeren 1 " .

