    nif:isString "NZ 's Bolger says Nats to meet NZ First on Sunday .  WELLINGTON 1996-12-06  New Zealand Prime Minister Jim Bolger , emerging from coalition talks with the nationalist New Zealand First party on Friday afternoon , said National and NZ First would meet again on Sunday .  Bolger said he expected a government to be formed by Thursday . " .

