    nif:isString "SOCCER - RESULT IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION .  MADRID 1996-08-31  Result of game played in the  Spanish first division on Saturday :  Deportivo Coruna 1 Real Madrid 1 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/962fc205fe91ef5ecc318bb065a4055c72b493ca15f079d8c3baf6108c1a4103> a nif:Context,
