    nif:isString "SOCCER - ASIAN CUP GROUP C RESULTS .  AL-AIN , United Arab Emirates 1996-12-06  Results of Asian Cup group C matches played on Friday :  Japan 2 Syria 1 ( halftime 0-1 )  Scorers :  Japan - Hassan Abbas 84 own goal , Takuya Takagi 88 .  Syria - Nader Jokhadar 7  Attendance : 10,000 .  China 0 Uzbekistan 2 ( halftime 0-0 )  Scorers : Shkvyrin Igor 78 , Shatskikh Oleg 90  Attendence : 3,000  Standings ( tabulate under played , won , drawn , lost , goals  for , goals against , points ) :  Uzbekistan 1 1 0 0 2 0 3  Japan 1 1 0 0 2 1 3  Syria 1 0 0 1 1 2 0  China 1 0 0 1 0 2 0 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/96fb53fdd929bbd0d2061c66da8ab320b367a1a69a1b5b93d47327ed03ee21ae> a nif:Context,
