    nif:endIndex "424"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "Voting begins in second round of Lebanese election .  TRIPOLI , Lebanon 1996-08-25  Voting began on Sunday in north Lebanon in the second round of parliamentary elections with 580,000 voters eligible to choose 28 members of the 128-member parliament .  A thin trickle of voters began casting their ballots in this northern port city for the five rival lists of candidates as polling stations opened at 7 a.m. ( 0400 gmt ) . " .

