    nif:isString "HORSE RACING - TATTERSALLS BREEDERS STAKES RESULT .  DUBLIN 1996-08-31  Result of the Tattersalls Breeders Stakes , a race for two-year-olds run over six furlongs ( 1,200  metres ) at The Curragh on Saturday :  1. Miss Stamper 3-1 joint-favourite ( ridden by David Harrison )  2. Paddy Lad 16-1 ( Peter Bloomfield )  3. Pelham 10-1 ( Warren O'Connor )  Distances : Three lengths , two-and-a-half lengths .  Winner owned by John and Beryll Remblance and trained in  Britain by Richard Hannon .  Value to the winning owner : $ 233,600 " .

