    nif:isString "CRICKET - ENGLAND 326 AND 74-0 ; PAKISTAN 521-8 DECLARED .  LONDON 1996-08-25  England were 74 for no wicket in  their second innings at the close of the fourth day of the third  and final test at The Oval on Sunday .  Scores : England 326 and 74-0 ; Pakistan 521-8 declared . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/9b6a6cbcbe90d8eb3026f49f055ffd90afb736420dd34c0d11617c2917f70cf7> a nif:Context,
