    nif:isString "SOCCER - AUSTRIA FIRST DIVISION RESULTS / STANDINGS .  VIENNA 1996-08-24  Results of Austria first division  soccer matches played on Saturday :  Rapid Vienna 0 FC Linz 0  GAK 2 Austria Vienna 2  Admira / Wacker 0 Sturm Graz 3  Linzer ASK 1 FC Tirol Innsbruck 3  Standings ( tabulated under played , won , drawn , lost , goals  for , against , points ) :  FC Tirol Innsbruck 6 4 2 0 13 5 14  Austria Vienna 6 4 2 0 9 5 14  SV Salzburg 5 3 2 0 4 1 11  Sturm Graz 6 2 3 1 8 5 9  GAK 6 1 3 2 8 10 6  Rapid Wien 5 0 5 0 3 3 5  SV Ried 5 1 1 3 6 5 4  Linzer ASK 5 0 3 2 4 8 3  Admira / Wacker 6 0 3 3 5 10 3  FC Linz 6 0 2 4 1 9 2 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/9b82aeb47d8d81fbb633b3950f2df5aa40e96c68c041d0d152cd6d85e7495239> a nif:Context,
