    nif:isString "Japan 's Hashimoto leaves Brazil for Peru .  BRASILIA 1996-08-26  Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto left Brasilia on Monday for Lima , the penultimate stop on a 10-day Latin American tour , a Brazilian Foreign Ministry spokeswoman said .  Hashimoto , who has already visited Mexico and Chile , spent three days in Brazil .  After Peru , he was due to go to Costa Rica . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/9e77e5d5faf1e31a57eda88f4ef54609bbbc6a1baa18362f4c9147bf77cdc290> a nif:Context,
