    nif:endIndex "434"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    nif:isString "RTRS - Cricket - Play restarts in Australia-West Indies match .  MELBOURNE 1996-12-06  Play restarted in the first World Series limited overs match between West Indies and Australia after a rain delay of 50 minutes on Friday .  West Indies resumed their innings on 53 for two with opener Sherwin Campbell on 25 and Shivnarine Chanderpaul 10 .  Rain earlier delayed the start of play by 30 minutes .  -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800 " .

