    nif:isString "BASKETBALLSOCCER - TROFEJ BEOGRAD TOURNAMENT RESULTS .  BELGRADE 1996-08-31  Results in the Trofej Beograd 96  international basketball tournament on Saturday :  Fifth place :  Benetton ( Italy ) 92 Dinamo ( Russia ) 81 ( halftime 50-28 )  Third place :  Alba ( Germany ) 75 Red Star ( Yugoslavia ) 70 ( 42-41 ) " .

