    nif:isString "CRICKET - MILLNS SIGNS FOR BOLAND .  CAPE TOWN 1996-08-22  South African provincial side Boland said on Thursday they had signed Leicestershire fast bowler David Millns on a one year contract .  Millns , who toured Australia with England A in 1992/93 , replaces former England all-rounder Phillip DeFreitas as Boland 's overseas professional . " .

