    nif:isString "SOCCER - ROMANIA BEAT LITHUANIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER .  BUCHAREST 1996-08-31  Romania beat Lithuania 3-0 ( halftime 1-0 ) in a World Cup soccer European group 8 qualifier on Saturday .  Scorers :  Romania - Viorel Moldovan ( 21st minute ) , Dan Petrescu ( 65th ) , Constantin Galca ( 77th )  Attendence : 9,000 " .

