    nif:isString "MOTOR RACING - LEADING QUALIFIERS FOR VANCOUVER INDYCAR RACE .  VANCOUVER 1996-08-31  Top ten drivers in grid for  Sunday 's Vancouver IndyCar race after final qualifying on  Saturday ( tabulate by driver , country , chassis , motor and lap  times in seconds ) :  1. Alex Zanardi ( Italy ) , Reynard Honda , 53.980 ( 113.576  mph / 182.778 kph )  2. Michael Andretti ( U.S. ) , Lola Ford Cosworth , 54.483  3. Bobby Rahal ( U.S. ) , Reynard Mercedes-Benz , 54.507  4. Bryan Herta ( U.S. ) , Reynard Mercedes-Benz , 54.578  5. Jimmy Vasser ( U.S. ) , Reynard Honda , 54.617  6. Paul Tracy ( Canada ) , Penske Mercedes-Benz , 54.620  7. Al Unser Jr ( U.S. ) , Penske Mercedes-Benz , 54.683  8. Andre Ribeiro ( Brazil ) , Lola Honda , 54.750  9. Mauricio Gugelmin ( Brazil ) , Reynard Ford Cosworth , 54.762  10. Gil de Ferran ( Brazil ) , Reynard Honda , 54.774 " .

