    nif:isString "U.S. DLA sets tin price at $ 2.7975 per lb .  WASHINGTON 1996-08-29  The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency set Thursday 's offering price for stockpile tin at $ 2.7975 per lb , versus $ 2.7775 per lb yesterday . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/a58c677fff3c6d7fb6a3dfb664e34bb4915107c7181e0c59b653543866815478> a nif:Context,
