    nif:isString "Zimbabwe executes convicted murderer .  HARARE 1996-12-06  Zimbabwe hanged a convicted murderer on Friday , bringing to eight the number of executions carried out in the past year .  A statement said Piniel Sindiso Ncube was hanged at dawn .  President Robert Mugabe 's government has resisted pressure from local and international human rights groups to abolish the death sentence . " .

