    nif:isString "CRICKET - SRI LANKA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS .  COLOMBO 1996-08-30  Sri Lanka beat Australia by four wickets in the third match of the Singer World Series one-day ( 50 overs ) cricket tournament on Friday .  Scores : Australia 228-9 in 50 overs , Sri Lanka 232-6 in 45.5 overs . " .

