    nif:isString "Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Continental .  LONDON 1996-08-23  Goldman Sachs & Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued a total of five million American-style call warrants , on Continental AG , lead manager Goldman Sachs & Co said .  One warrant controls one share .  STRIKE PRICE 25.00 DEM PREMIUM 10.12 PCT  ISSUE PRICE 2.42 DEM GEARING 10.29 X  EXERCISE PERIOD 02.SEP.96-21.NOV.97 PAYDATE 30.AUG.96  LISTING DDF FFT STG MIN EXER LOT 100  SPOT REFERENCE 24.90 DEM  -- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658 " .

