    nif:isString "CRICKET - ENGLAND 100-2 AT LUNCH ON FIRST DAY OF THIRD TEST .  LONDON 1996-08-22  England were 100 for two at lunch on the first day of the third and final test against Pakistan at The Oval on Thursday . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/abd9c42137f27f4c9eb35c3348ec9239bf219a51b93fae1e64ee2de4ef1f779c> a nif:Context,
