    nif:isString "Cholera kills 21 in southern Nigeria .  LAGOS 1996-05-28  An outbreak of cholera has killed 21 people in a week at Ubimini in oil-rich southern Nigeria , the News Agency of Nigeria reported on Saturday .  The chairman of the local council , Damian Ejiohuo , said drugs had been rushed to the area to quell the disease and the community needed a safer source of drinking water to prevent future outbreaks .  Epidemics are common in rural areas of Nigeria where piped water is not usually available . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/b08a99e1b860ab443887efa4bd5bb0bb3a8c032f5083f98af2c58aaa10c74bdf> a nif:Context,
