    nif:isString "London coal / ore fixtures .  LONDON 1996-12-06  COAL - Lantau Peak - 120,000 tones coal Hay Point or Newcastle / Kaohsiung 20-30/1 $ 5.25 and $ 5.85 fio respectively 40,000-35,000 / 28,000 shinc China Steel .  Royal Clipper - 77,000 tonnes coal Maracaibo / Fos 19/12-2/1 $ 9.90 fio 20,000 shinc / 25,000 shinc Coe and Clerici .  ORE - IMC TBN - 70,000 tonnes Dampier / Kaohsiung 20-30/12 $ 5.25 fio 35,000 shinc / 30,000 shinc China Steel . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/b2151c0dd5f94640c6d7318eba663a427f7004e1fb224f600c8a08063859af0a> a nif:Context,
