    nif:isString "Nato declines comment on fighting in Iraq .  BRUSSELS 1996-08-31  The North Atlantic Treaty Organisation 's spokesman on Saturday declined all comment on reports of armed conflict in northern Iraq .  But a NATO official told Reuters : \" We are watching the situation closely . \"  Earlier on Saturday , an Iraqi Kurd leader said both Iraqi troops and Kurdistan Democratic Party ( KDP ) forces were attacking the city of Arbil in northern Iraq . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/b45d07202eccbdfdeed41d917f4c0215f22c524a392dfea83538fa2c846fa19a> a nif:Context,
