    nif:isString "BOXING - MILLER DEFENDS WBA CRUISERWEIGHT TITLE .  DUBLIN 1996-08-31  American Nate Miller successfully defended his WBA cruiserweight title when he knocked out compatriot James Heath in the seventh round of their bout on Saturday . " .

