    nif:isString "SOCCER - SUMMARIES OF GERMAN FIRST DIVISION MATCHES .  BONN 1996-08-24  Summaries of German first division  matches played on Saturday :  Bochum 1 ( Jack 66th minute ) Arminia Bielefeld 1 ( Molata 59th ) .  Halftime 0-0 .  Attendance 25,000  Borussia Moenchengladbach 1 ( Andersson 22nd ) Karlsruhe 3  ( Haessler 33rd , Dundee 45th , Keller 90th ) .  1-2 .  20,000  Stuttgart 2 ( Balakow 50th , Bobic 61st ) Werder Bremen 1 ( Votava  68th ) .  0-0 .  32,000  1860 Munich 1 ( Schwabl 38th ) Borussia Dortmund 3 ( Zorc  59th-pen , Moeller 73rd , Heinrich 90th ) .  1-0 .  50,000  Bayer Leverkusen 0 Fortuna Duesseldorf 1 ( Seeliger 47th ) .  0-0 .  18,000  Freiburg 1 ( Zeyer 52nd ) Cologne 3 ( Gaissmayer 9th , Polster  86th , 90th ) .  0-1 .  22,500 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/bd87e96d3aeacae1a76b8cfc427fbae1ea413076785a9e3fe7ce7bb20add2dd5> a nif:Context,
