    nif:isString "MOTORCYCLING - SAN MARINO GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES .  IMOLA , Italy 1996-08-30  Practice times set on Friday  for Sunday 's San Marino 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix :  1. Michael Doohan ( Australia ) Honda one minute 50.250  2. Jean-Michel Bayle ( France ) Yamaha 1:50.727  3. Norifumi Abe ( Japan ) Yamaha 1:50.858  4. Luca Cadalora ( Italy ) Honda 1:51.006  5. Alex Criville ( Spain ) Honda 1:51.075  6. Scott Russell ( United States ) Suzuki 1:51.287  7. Tadayuki Okada ( Japan ) Honda 1:51.528  8. Carlos Checa ( Spain ) Honda 1:51.588  9. Alexandre Barros ( Brazil ) Honda 1:51.784  10. Shinichi Itoh ( Japan ) Honda 1:51.857 " .

