    nif:isString "SOCCER - LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS .  PARIS 1996-08-24  Leading goalscorers in the French  first division after Saturday 's matches :  3 - Anto Drobnjak ( Bastia ) , Xavier Gravelaine ( Marseille ) .  2 - Miladin Becanovic ( Lille ) , Enzo Scifo ( Monaco ) ,  Vladimir Smicer ( Lens ) , Christopher Wreh ( Guingamp ) . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/c1215d1b44d3691dadf7cd175f4983860da8e3f42496c81c4e480ac821524d4b> a nif:Context,
