    nif:isString "BADMINTON - WORLD GRAND PRIX SEMIFINAL RESULTS .  TEMBAU DENPASAR , Bali 1996-12-07  Results of  semifinals at the World Grand Prix finals on Saturday :  Men 's singles  Fung Permadi ( Taiwan ) beat Indra Wijaya ( Indonesia ) 15-6 15-8  Sun Jun ( China ) beat Allan Budi Kusuma ( Indonesia ) 15-9 15-10  Women 's singles  Susi Susanti ( Indonesia ) beat Camilla Martin ( Denmark ) 11-1  11-3  Ye Zhaoying ( China ) beat Gong Zhichao ( China ) 11-8 11-3 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/c56acb9ce75db06422d3bd9fba2752e7408677b9e21cd1a6d0025b4c9c97f150> a nif:Context,
