    nif:isString "CRICKET - AUSTRALIA BEAT WEST INDIES BY FIVE WICKETS .  MELBOURNE 1996-12-06  Australia beat West Indies by five wickets in a World Series limited overs match at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Friday .  Scores : West Indies 172 all out in 49.2 overs ( Shivnarine Chanderpaul 54 ) ; Australia 173-5 in 48.4 overs ( Greg Blewett 57 not out ) . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/c6025fdf1ca8ef83d10360e31e824a4f5aaffba08552893ca4422e31391a132d> a nif:Context,
