    nif:isString "BASKETBALL - FORMULA SHELL WIN GAME ONE IN PHILIPPINES .  MANILA 1996-08-28  Result of game one of the Philippine Basketball Association second conference finals on Tuesday :  Formula Shell beat Alaska Milk 85-82 ( 36-46 )  ( Formula Shell leads best-of-seven series 1-0 ) " .

