    nif:isString "Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on DTB-Bund-Future .  LONDON 1996-08-27  Swiss Bank Corp says it has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants , in six equal tranches , on the DTB-Bund-Future March 1997 .  EXERCISE PERIOD 02.SEP.96-06.MAR.97 PAYDATE 30.AUG.96  LISTING FFT DDF MIN EXER LOT 100  SPOT REFERENCE 95.35 PCT  WARRANTS STRIKE ISS PRICE PREMIUM GEARING  CALL A 96.00 PCT 1.16 DEM 1.90 PCT 82.20 X  CALL B 97.00 PCT 0.75 DEM 2.50 PCT 127.10 X  CALL C 98.00 PCT 0.47 DEM 3.30 PCT 202.90 X  PUT D 94.00 PCT 0.94 DEM 2.40 PCT 101.40 X  PUT E 95.0 PCT 1.33 DEM 1.80 PCT 71.70 X  PUT F 96.0 PCT 1.84 DEM 1.20 PCT 51.80 X  -- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658 " .

