    nif:isString "Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet , no sales - USDA .  DODGE CITY 1996-08-27  Trade was quiet , with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed .  Inquiry and demand very light .  Sales confirmed week to date on 4,200 head , mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle .  Confirmed - none .  -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720-- " .

