    nif:isString "John Lewis UK store sales up 4.5 % in week .  LONDON 1996-12-06  The John Lewis Partnership said its UK department store sales rose 4.5 percent in the week to November 30 compared with the same week a year earlier .  In the 18 weeks to November 30 , sales were up 13.6 percent year-on-year .  Total sales , including the Waitrose supermarket chain , rose 5.8 percent in the week and were up 11.4 percent in the 18-week period .  -- Rosemary Bennett , London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/cd1f476e5f9d995216b80a112598eeeb80c9a551987e65be9627b4146fda1d21> a nif:Context,
