    nif:isString "First Alliance net income slips .  IRVINE , Calif. 1996-08-29  First Alliance Corporation and Subsidiaries  Quarter ended June 30 Six Months ended June 30  1996 1995 1996 1995  Unaudited  Total revenue  17,024,000 18,174,000 31,834,000 24,137,000  Total expense  7,718,000 6,828,000 14,668,000 13,091,000  Net Income 9,167,000 11,175,000 16,909,000 10,880,000  Net Income Per  Share 0.86 1.05 1.59 1.02  Weighted average number of  shares outstanding  10,650,407 10,650,407 10,650,407 10,650,407  Pro Forma :  Historical income before income  tax provision  9,306,000 11,346,000 17,166,000 11,046,000  Pro forma income tax  provision 3,820,000 4,658,000 7,047,000 4,534,000  Pro forma net  income 5,486,000 6,688,000 10,119,000 6,512,000  Pro forma net income  per share 0.37 0.45 0.68 0.44  Pro forma weighted average  number of shares  outstanding 14,775,000 14,775,000 14,775,000 14,775,000 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/ce5d5a5a0c15746a435bf585da94035107fa8f3a21c34f96d2daea752d3f2e58> a nif:Context,
