    nif:isString "FSA qualifies five muni bond issues for insurance .  NEW YORK 1996-08-28  Financial Security Assurance said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today :  -- Paris School District No 7 , Ark .  , $ 2.44 million refunding bonds .  -- St Ansgar Community School District , Iowa , $ 3.334 million general obligation school bonds .  -- Avalon Borough , N.J. , $ 11.4 million GOs .  -- Seaford Union Free School District , N.Y. , $ 5 million school bonds .  -- Akron , Ohio , $ 6.31 million improvement bonds .  -- U.S. Municipal Desk , 212-859-1650 " .

