    nif:isString "SOCCER - CANADA BEAT PANAMA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER .  EDMONTON 1996-08-31  Canada beat Panama 3-1 ( halftime 2-0 ) in their CONCACAF semifinal phase qualifying match for the 1998 World Cup on Friday .  Scorers :  Canada - Aunger ( 41st min , pen ) , Paul Peschisolido ( 42nd ) , Carlo Corrazin ( 87th )  Panama - Jorge Luis Dely Valdes ( 50th )  Attendance : 9,402 " .

