    nif:isString "ALPINE SKIING-GOETCHL WINS WORLD CUP DOWNHILL .  VAIL , Colorado 1996-12-07  Renate Goetschl of Austria won the women 's World Cup downhill race on Saturday , according to provisional results .  Katja Seizinger of Germany finished second and Islode Kostner of Italy took third . " .

