    nif:isString "CRICKET - ENGLAND NAME SQUAD FOR ONE-DAY INTERNATIONALS .  LONDON 1996-08-25  The England cricket squad was announced on Sunday for the one-day international series against Pakistan starting on Thursday .  Squad : Michael Atherton ( captain ) , Alec Stewart , Graham Thorpe , Nick Knight , Graham Lloyd , Matthew Maynard , Ronnie Irani , Adam Hollioake , Robert Croft , Darren Gough , Peter Martin , Dean Headley , Alan Mullally . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/dcf5bc1525d4a348ff4128da0735016693c36e0fe686413b6f288e1bf7c95997> a nif:Context,
