    nif:isString "RALLYING - LEADING POSITIONS IN 1,000 LAKES RALLY .  JYVASKLYA , Finland 1996-08-25  Leading positions on  Sunday after 23 special stages in the 1,000 Lakes Rally , sixth  round of the world championship :  1. Tommi Makinen ( Finland ) Mitsubishi Lancer three hours  eight minutes one second  2. Juha Kankkunen ( Finland ) Toyota Celica 12 seconds  behind  3. Marcus Gronholm ( Finland ) Toyota Celica 2:09  4. Jarmo Kytolehto ( Finland ) Ford Escort 2:23  5. Kenneth Eriksson ( Sweden ) Subaru Impreza 2:39  6. Carlos Sainz ( Spain ) Ford Escort 3:03 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/dde54c3e36f8c4f8045969d59ac506e7d370daa72b95bc7c2eaee5e6a8a597fd> a nif:Context,
