    nif:isString "VNU details first-half operating profits .  HAARLEM , Netherlands 1996-08-27  Publisher VNU gave the following breakdown of its first-half results :  H1 1996 H1 1995  Sales Op profit Sales Op profit  Consumer magazines 618 90 568 80  Newspapers 363 49 295 46  Commercial TV 127 6 loss 174 33 profit  Business info Europe 231 24 178 18  Business info USA 382 61 362 41  Education 42 6 36 3  Miscellaneous charges --- 16 --- 30  NOTES - Sales and operating profit are given in millions of guilders .  Commercial TV includes pro rata share of sales and operating profits in Dutch group HMG and Belgium 's VTM .  -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 , Fax +31 20 504 5040 " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/de2f5329f0314515c0d19d26baa854d0e97d03aca25e29cb92619a5bdad7e2a0> a nif:Context,
