    nif:isString "BOXING - PRINCE NASEEM RETAINS WBO FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE .  DUBLIN 1996-08-31  Britain 's Naseem Hamed retained his WBO featherweight title on Saturday when Mexico 's Manuel Medina was retired by his corner at the end of the 11th round . " .

