    nif:isString "RTRS - Toyota Australia workers to return to work .  MELBOURNE 1996-08-23  Over 2,000 striking workers voted on Friday to return to work on Monday at Toyota Australia 's Melbourne assembly line , ending a two-week stoppage . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/e1d66e2f8c60c67cb4b8c8e948881874e0d9680b5b41f9aa3533ebc4c9fba741> a nif:Context,
