    nif:isString "CBOT rice closes higher on technical bounce .  CHICAGO 1996-08-26  CBOT rice futures closed higher on a technical bounce tied to signs the market was oversold , traders said .  \" It rallied on ideas the market was oversold , \" a trader said .  Traders said the U.S. cash market remains well above the benchmark Thai price which limited gains .  Rice futures volume was estimated at 450 contracts , up from 202 Friday .  Rice options volume was estimated at 50 contracts , down from 56 Friday .  Rice futures closed 13 to 16 cents per cwt higher , with September up 16 at $ 10.28 a cwt .  Sam Nelson 312-408-8721 " .

