    nif:isString "BASKETBALL - BENETTON BEAT DINAMO 92-81 .  BELGRADE 1996-08-31  Benetton of Italy beat Dinamo of Russia 92-81 ( halftime 50-28 ) in a fifth place play-off in the Trofej Beograd 96 international basketball tournament on Saturday . " .

