    nif:isString "CRICKET - AUSTRALIA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY 125 RUNS IN ONE-DAY MATCH .  COLOMBO 1996-08-26  Australia beat Zimbabwe by 125 runs in the first match of the Singer World Series one-day ( 50 overs ) cricket tournament on Monday .  Scores : Australia 263-7 in 50 overs , Zimbabwe 138 all out in 41 overs . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/ece08c698719da0df4fd31b6c248a7caa607d21a3970189d8e416addbc9dcbdb> a nif:Context,
