    nif:isString "SOCCER - SILVA 'S `LOST PASSPORT ' EXCUSE NOT ENOUGH FOR FIFA .  MADRID 1996-08-30  Spanish first division team Deportivo Coruna will be without key midfielder Mauro Silva for Saturday 's game with Real Madrid after FIFA , soccer 's world governing body , suspended the Brazilian for one game for missing his national side 's European tour .  Silva excused his absence from Brazil 's game against Russia , on Wednesday , and Saturday 's match with the Netherlands by saying he had lost his passport .  But that did not prevent him from collecting the one-match suspension . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/ef456b4eecd4107ea2d170af19312546d75c674dfc390f1e21cc1ecd032ebcd2> a nif:Context,
