    nif:isString "SOCCER - UKRAINE BEAT NORTHERN IRELAND IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER .  BELFAST 1996-08-31  Ukraine beat Northern Ireland 1-0 ( halftime 0-0 ) in a World Cup soccer European group nine qualifier on Saturday .  Scorer : Sergei Rebrov ( 79th minute )  Attendance : 9,358 " .

