    nif:isString "PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Aug 22 .  BAGHDAD 1996-08-22  These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Thursday .  Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy .  THAWRA  - Iraq 's President Saddam Hussein meets with chairman of the Russian liberal democratic party Vladimir Zhirinovsky .  - Turkish foreign minister says Turkey will take part in the Baghdad trade fair that will be held in November .  IRAQ  - A shipload of 12 tonnes of rice arrives in Umm Qasr port in the Gulf . " .

