    nif:isString "CRICKET - AUSTRALIA 263-7 IN 50 OVERS V ZIMBABWE .  COLOMBO 1996-08-26  Australia scored 263-7 in their 50 overs against Zimbabwe in the first day-night limited overs match of the Singer World Series tournament on Monday . " .

