    nif:isString "SOCCER - GOTHENBURG PUT FERENCVAROS OUT OF EURO CUP .  BUDAPEST 1996-08-21  IFK Gothenburg of Sweden drew 1-1 ( 1-0 ) with Ferencvaros of Hungary in the second leg of their European Champions Cup preliminary round tie played on Wednesday .  Gothenburg go through 4-1 on aggregate .  Scorers :  Ferencvaros :  Ferenc Horvath ( 15th )  IFK Gothenburg :  Andreas Andersson ( 87th )  Attendance : 9,000 " .

