    nif:isString "Russians , rebels sign deal in Chechnya .  NOVYE ATAGI , Russia 1996-08-22  Russian President Boris Yeltsin 's security supremo Alexander Lebed and Chechen rebel chief-of-staff Aslan Maskhadov signed a deal on Thursday aimed at ending three weeks of renewed fighting in the region .  The final contents of the document negotiated in this village south of the Chechen capital Grozny have not been officially disclosed .  Itar-Tass news agency said it provided for the disengagement of Russian and rebel forces in Chechnya . " .

<https://anonymiz.ed/AIDA-YAGO2-dataset/fd8827ce40db23ef6035f5fabc4561b2a13e4f57de24d195bd17ddfdb1800c71> a nif:Context,
